    "enUS": {
      "description": "It is the way of the divine to help those in need.  The how is insignificant -- only the why matters.\n\nThe Cenarion Circle has such a need.  Speak with Ogtinc to lend aid to their plight.  He resides atop the cliffs to the northeast of the Ruins of Eldarath in Azshara.",
      "summary": "Seek out Ogtinc in Azshara.",
      "title": "Cenarion Aid",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
